      "id": "code",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "source": "count = Counter(nums)\nbuckets = [[] for _ in range(n + 1)]\n\nfor num, freq in count.items():\n    buckets[freq].append(num)\n\nout = []\nfor freq in range(n, 0, -1):\n    for num in buckets[freq]:\n        out.append(num)\n        if len(out) == k: return out"
    },
